  "title": "acme-pagination-previous",
  "text": "# acme-pagination-previous\n\nCoordinated result navigation with application-owned pages, page size and data loading.\n\n## `<acme-pagination-previous>`\n\nRequests the previous available page without changing application state.\n\nVersion: 0.2.0\nSource: src/components/pagination-previous/pagination-previous.ts\n\n### Attributes and properties\n\n| Attribute | Property | Type | Default | Access | Inherited from | Description |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| ` href ` | ` href ` | ` string ` | ` \"\" ` | Set | ` AcmePaginationAction ` |  |\n| ` size ` | ` size ` | ` \"small\" \\| \"medium\" \\| \"large\" \\| \"tiny\" ` | ` \"medium\" ` | Set or omit | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` variant ` | ` variant ` | ` \"error\" \\| \"default\" \\| \"secondary\" \\| \"warning\" \\| \"tertiary\" \\| \"unstyled\" ` | ` \"tertiary\" ` | Set or omit | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` disabled ` | ` disabled ` | ` boolean ` | ` false ` | Set | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` loading ` | ` loading ` | ` boolean ` | ` false ` | Set | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` shape ` | ` shape ` | ` ActionShape \\| undefined ` | ` — ` | Set or omit | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` full-width ` | ` fullWidth ` | ` boolean ` | ` false ` | Set | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` ripple ` | ` ripple ` | ` boolean \\| undefined ` | ` — ` | Set or omit | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` width ` | ` width ` | ` string \\| undefined ` | ` — ` | Set or omit | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` height ` | ` height ` | ` string \\| undefined ` | ` — ` | Set or omit | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` role ` | ` role ` | ` string \\| null ` | ` — ` | Set | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` aria-label ` | ` ariaLabel ` | ` string \\| null ` | ` — ` | Set | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` aria-haspopup ` | ` ariaHasPopup ` | ` string \\| null ` | ` — ` | Set | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` aria-expanded ` | ` ariaExpanded ` | ` string \\| null ` | ` — ` | Set | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` aria-autocomplete ` | ` ariaAutoComplete ` | ` string \\| null ` | ` — ` | Set | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` — ` | ` ariaActiveDescendantElement ` | ` Element \\| null ` | ` — ` | Set | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` — ` | ` ariaControlsElements ` | ` Element[] \\| null ` | ` — ` | Set | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` — ` | ` ariaLabelledByElements ` | ` Element[] \\| null ` | ` — ` | Set | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` — ` | ` ariaDescribedByElements ` | ` Element[] \\| null ` | ` — ` | Set | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n\n### Additional attributes\n\n| Attribute | Type | Default | Description |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ` aria-labelledby ` | ` string ` | ` — ` | IDs in the author's tree scope that label the native root. |\n| ` aria-describedby ` | ` string ` | ` — ` | IDs in the author's tree scope that describe the native root. |\n| ` aria-controls ` | ` string ` | ` — ` | IDs in the author's tree scope controlled by the native root. |\n| ` aria-activedescendant ` | ` string ` | ` — ` | ID of the active item in the author's scope. |\n\n### Methods\n\n| Signature | Inherited from | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| ` focus(options?: FocusOptions): void ` | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` blur(): void ` | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` click(): void ` | ` AcmeActionElement ` |  |\n| ` getAttribute(name: string): string \\| null ` | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` hasAttribute(name: string): boolean ` | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` removeAttribute(name: string): void ` | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n| ` toggleAttribute(name: string, force?: boolean): boolean ` | ` AcmeSemanticElement ` |  |\n\n### Slots\n\n| Name | Description |\n|---|---|\n| ` (default) ` | Label; defaults to localized Previous. |\n\n### CSS parts\n\n| Part | Description |\n|---|---|\n| ` item ` | Native page navigation action. |\n| ` root ` |  |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Ownership**\n\n- Handle acme-request to update page or pageSize. The component does not fetch, slice results or reset the current page.\n- The optional Page Size part starts with [10,25,50]. Supply its options property for other choices. The current supplied size is always represented.\n- A failed load can leave the page unchanged. Clear loading to allow retry.\n\n**Semantics**\n\n- Previous, Next and numbered items are ordinary buttons unless href or getPageUrl supplies a destination.\n- A known count of zero reads No results. Without count, the position reads only the current page and Next requires hasNextPage=true.\n- An out-of-range supplied page stays unchanged. Previous requests the last valid page; application code decides whether to accept it.\n- Numbered items announce their page and expose aria-current on the current item. Ellipses are not actions.\n\n**Composition**\n\n- Use ordinary layout for position, actions and page-size controls. Use Group when attached action surfaces are needed.\n- For a jump-to-page field, compose Number Input and handle its requested value in the application.\n- Previous/next documentation links are ordinary Link and Stack composition, separate from result pagination.\n",
